  "body": "- Adds `AccessControlAction.VariablesRead|Create|Write|Delete` and switches `/dashboards/variables` routes + navtree to those actions (list = read; new = create; edit = write|create).\r\n- Hides New / Move / Delete / edit links in the management UI when the user lacks the matching permission; read-only list remains for Viewers.\r\n- Folder Variables tab matches the same gates (`variables:create` + folder CanEdit for New; `variables:write` for edit links; no bulk checkboxes).\r\n- Global/root scope in the editor and move modal is Admin-only (matches backend #129470). Folder-only help text is shown when the user cannot pick root — leftover from #129249.\r\n\r\nBackend Variable RBAC is already on main (#129470). This is the frontend follow-up.\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n\r\n- [x] **Viewer:** Variables nav + list visible; no New / Move / Delete; name is not an edit link; `/new` and `/edit/...` blocked\r\n- [x] **Editor:** folder-scoped CRUD where they have folder Edit; **no** root/global in the folder picker or move modal; cannot save/delete root vars\r\n- [x] **Admin:** full management including root/global create, edit, move, delete\r\n- [x] **Viewer + folder Edit:** can create/edit/delete that folder’s vars; New is hidden on the main page until they have `variables:create` somewhere; folder tab New is enabled for that folder; root still hidden\r\n- [x] **Folder Variables tab:** without `variables:create`, no New button; without `variables:write`, names are not edit links\r\n- [x] Confirm over-showing vs under-showing: backend remains source of truth for 403s",
  "changed_files": 14,
  "closed_at": "2026-08-28T14:07:48Z",
